{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/194373-unfleshed-the-god-machine\u2019s-created","id":194373,"title":"Unfleshed: the God-Machine\u2019s Created?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-10T23:28:02-07:00","id":194373,"title":"Unfleshed: the God-Machine\u2019s Created?","content":"A theory I\u2019ve been toying with: going with the notion that the Principle and the God-Machine are separate entities roughly analogous to Gnosticism\u2019s Creator and Demiurge respectively, and that <i>qashmallim</i> are to the Principle as GMC\u2019s angels are to the God-Machine, what if the Unfleshed are somehow associated with the God-Machine?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T23:33:36-07:00","id":194384,"title":"","content":"It does parse, doesn't it? Although I think you might be missing a simpler train of thought. THe God-Machine, reasonably, probably wants to gain understanding and mastery over all the forces it can get a hold of. Pyros is one of those weird out of those context problems that, nevertheless, seems to run on patterns-patterns similar to what the G-M itself uses. So, to be better understand and control the force, it needs to experiment with it, poke it and prod it and scan it and dissect it in all possible ways. It can't work up the desperation to do so, so it works through Demiurges.<br /> <br /> In short, G-M inspired Unfleshed are the result of experimentation for the purpose of greater mastery of this world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T00:09:46-07:00","id":194391,"title":"","content":"The Divine Fire manifests in many ways. As man leaves magic behind (or claims to, anyway) in favor of technology, the latter simply becomes another outlet for obsession and new souls. I think the Unfleshed are nothing more than the newest lineage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum