rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Divine Fire manifests in many ways. As man leaves magic behind (or claims to, anyway) in favor of technology, the latter simply becomes another outlet for obsession and new souls. I think the Unfleshed are nothing more than the newest lineage.</div> </div> </div> </div>The desperate need muses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T07:21:17-07:00","id":194616,"title":"","content":"Please elaborate\u2026","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T07:26:53-07:00","id":194620,"title":"","content":"I did already. I can see the Unfleshed being a product of G-M experimentation, although I maintain that a certain level of human desperation is needed. Fortunately, the G-M has an entire class of angels for dropping ideas on the people who could become Demiurges.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T07:34:52-07:00","id":194623,"title":"","content":"And it\u2019s interesting to note that they\u2019re the splat that includes Prometheans among its \u201cStereotypes\u201d. Not to derail my own thread, but I\u2019ve remarked in the past that it would be difficult to distinguish between an Elpidim and a Messenger, or a Lilithim and a Destroyer.<br /> <br /> Speaking of Destroyers, I\u2019ve also been wondering if the God-Machine might be behind the creation of the Nuclear Prometheans\u2026 But that might be a bridge too far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","user":"Dataweaver","date":". 07-11-2014, 10:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T08:45:52-07:00","id":194650,"title":"","content":"The way I'd play it is that the Unfleshed are still built by mortal demiurges, but mortals are driven to become demiurges through occult matrices and other angelic activity. Some demiurges become obsessed with breathing life into machines after a chance encounter with a poorly disguised angel, or with the gears of the God-Machine itself. Any mortal who becomes a demiurge as a result of the God-Machine's efforts ends up creating the Unfleshed rather than any other lineage. <br /> <br /> Why does the GM put in so much effort into pushing mortals into the obsession of the demiurge? The God-Machine and its projects can only run on essence - the divine fire, by contrast is a fickle force that can only be molded by mortals, prometheans, and (most importantly) the Qashmallim. No mortal or demon knows for sure why the God-Machine will focus its attention on the Qashmallim. It is well known that they cannot be created by an occult matrix, but they are often attracted to the fires that burn within the unfleshed. Some speculate that the God-Machine needs to draw out any Qashmallim that it calculates as a threat to a particular project, while others note that on rare occasions Qashmallim can be killed and recycled in elimination infrastructure. Few think that the subsequent appearance of high rank angels is a coincidence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T09:52:22-07:00","id":194726,"title":"","content":"Okay, I'll bite, what's the theory behind the GM being behind the nuclear prometheans? As it is the GM seems more aligned with electricity, the normal elemental medium for pyros.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-11T10:23:09-07:00","id":194757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/194373-unfleshed-the-god-machine\u2019s-created?p=194623#post194623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not to derail my own thread, but I\u2019ve remarked in the past that it would be difficult to distinguish between an Elpidim and a Messenger, or a Lilithim and a Destroyer.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my World of Darkness, <i>there's nothing to distinguish</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Not that it's ever come up, mind...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":877,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/877-mugasofer","user":"MugaSofer","date":". 07-11-2014, 01:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/877-mugasofer","name":"MugaSofer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar877_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-12T23:16:52-07:00","id":196057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/194373-unfleshed-the-god-machine\u2019s-created#post194373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A theory I\u2019ve been toying with: going with the notion that the Principle and the God-Machine are separate entities roughly analogous to Gnosticism\u2019s Creator and Demiurge respectively, and that <i>qashmallim</i> are to the Principle as GMC\u2019s angels are to the God-Machine, what if the Unfleshed are somehow associated with the God-Machine?</div> </div> </div> </div>All it means is that they are built for one inscrutable purpose instead of another. Prometheans aren't under any actual obligation to the Pyros, nor do they experience any sort of direct communion with it, though they often are the recipients of its inspirations. The Pyros doesn't control, demand, or program, but the God Machine does. Do the Unfleshed share the Created's autonomy, or are they subject to the G-M's strictures? Are they as cut off, or do they have a direct feed? These are the immediate children of the what-if, and if they are part of the Machine, what purpose do they serve? Why do they have Pyros, instead of Essence or Aether? Why not simply subvert or compromise a fleshy Promethean?<br /> <br /> My take: they're primitive angels. True, full-blown angels capable of being fully-integrated with the God-Machine are not easy to make. The God-Machine has plenty, but finite numbers, and every now and then one needs to be replaced. Used to mean capturing a qashmallim and converting it by running it through dozens of occult matrices, but with the advent of robotics, the God-Machine is capable of constructing biomechanical armatures capable of accepting the Divine Fire. Get some poor Demiurge to animate it, then the GM captures it, and retrofits it with all the necessary components for its mission. All that remains of its Azoth is trapped inside a sealed reactor.<br /> <br /> &quot;Regular&quot; Prometheans had been forced, many, many times through the process, but the only occult matrix that accepts Prometheans is the New Dawn itself, and its only outputs are mortals and the most distraught of all Prometheans, which are the least useful. The Created <i>can</i> be used in other matrices, but only catastrophic failures occur, so now the GM uses captive Prometheans as elimination Infrastructure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T06:42:25-07:00","id":197874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/194373-unfleshed-the-god-machine\u2019s-created?p=194623#post194623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not to derail my own thread, but I\u2019ve remarked in the past that it would be difficult to distinguish between an Elpidim and a Messenger, or a Lilithim and a Destroyer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Surely the Elpidos would be better compared to a Wheel? <i>Agents of beginnings</i>, after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T10:17:35-07:00","id":198032,"title":"","content":"Wheels are about moving things around; Messengers are about providing guidance. The Elpidim provide guidance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T13:43:49-07:00","id":198192,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/194373-unfleshed-the-god-machine\u2019s-created?p=198032#post198032\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wheels are about moving things around; Messengers are about providing guidance. The Elpidim provide guidance.</div> </div> </div> </div>And Destroyers are the Machine's erasers. What part of the Screaming Shadow or Marion says &quot;Sword&quot; to you?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 08-12-2014, 03:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T14:34:37-07:00","id":198237,"title":"","content":"Lilithim: Catalysts of Entropy. And Cacophony Embeds are every bit as much the sort of thing I\u2019d expect of a Lilithim as of a Destroyer.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T15:06:26-07:00","id":198254,"title":"","content":"You seem to have confused Swords with their Unchained brethren:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Angels: As angels, Destroyers were tasked with removing targets swiftly and neatly. <b>Their attention was irrevocable</b> \u2014 if sent to destroy a magical artifact, angelic Destroyers would make sure it could never be put back together after they were done, and they never just wounded living targets instead of killing them. A mortal who somehow escaped would be hunted, singlemindedly, until the angel brought down its prey.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">The God-Machine deployed Destroyers to eliminate threats to Infrastructure \u2014 humans or supernatural beings that were interfering with the Gears or coming close to ruining a matrix\u2014or to eradicate unsalvageable Infrastructure after a failure or once it had completed its purpose. Their targets were not always living people\u2014Unchained Destroyers remember <b>removing all trace</b> of a departed angel with ruthless efficiency, or reducing houses to rubble\u2014but the God-Machine prefers to recycle materials where possible, so the majority of missions were assassination.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">[\u2026]</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">The Descent: Destroyers have a harder time reconciling their former purpose with the need to maintain Cover than the other Incarnations. Guardians, Psychopomps, and Messengers can all find uses in human society for their inbuilt talents and instincts, but <b>Destroyers were built for murder and brutal, efficient demolition.</b><br /> [\u2026]</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\">As they Descend, many Destroyers experiment with turning their talents to less literal forms of death, applying themselves to the destruction of ideas, societies, friendships, or other concepts. <b>Although some were sent on similar missions by the God-Machine, it reserved warrior angels for cases where an idea or cause had to be completely eradicated. </b>For everything else, Messengers and Psychopomps were better suited.</span></span><br /> <br /> Swords are not terribly nuanced.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}